        "message": "fix(benchmarks): 裁定批 H——applicability 双断言根因修复（CI bootstrap-clean 红的最终修复；裁决 15）\n\n① explain-api-sec-excluded-with-capability-why 21/24 缺 3：D3 入册的 backend\n  lane SEC 三卡（TRUST_BOUNDARY_ENFORCEMENT/NO_CLIENT_SIDE_TRUST/SECURITY_\n  RELAXATION_GATE）applies_when 补 capabilities=[CAPABILITY.API_CONTRACT] 轴\n  （T3 标注战役收尾——契约面安全治理语义）→ 24/24 全带 why 详情。\n② db-domain-absence 绊线改判卷式：O9「真实 catalog 零 DB 域条目」前提经 B6\n  播种移植（D3 入册 BE.DB + B6c STACK.PERSISTENCE）被推翻——按断言自带指引\n  重审：出现不再是绊线，无排除详情才是（DB 条目须全部 excluded 且 why_\n  excluded 携带详情，泄漏语义与 API/Sec 族同构；fixture-only 真判卷不变）。\n  裁决 15 入账 + views 重建 byte-stable。\n\n验证：主仓 applicability 单跑全断言 PASS（24/24+DB 2 excluded 判卷式）/\nrun-all 4/4 PASS / 全测 181 files 0 failed / ratchet 3664 / eslint 0 /\nbuild-all ok / relock refreshed 3 幂等 270。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
